data_AF3_TEMPLATE_D_NO_RECORDS
#
# Deliberately not a structure: lexically well-formed mmCIF text with a data
# block, a title and no atom or polymer records at all. The builder refuses it
# at the file prompt ("no _atom_site, _entity_poly, _struct_asym or _entity
# records"), because AF3 would have no structure to read.
#
_struct.title 'AF3 builder fixture D: an mmCIF file with no structure in it'
#
